    <briefdescription>
<para>A <computeroutput><ref refid="" kindref="compound">ThreadLocal</ref></computeroutput> variant optimized for short-lived thread-locals. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Essentially, if the reference to the thread-local is not <javadoccode>static</javadoccode>, it will be advantageous to use a <computeroutput><ref refid="df/d35/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1util_1_1_transient_thread_local" kindref="compound">TransientThreadLocal</ref></computeroutput> rather than a <computeroutput><ref refid="" kindref="compound">ThreadLocal</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>&lt;T&gt;</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the value type </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
